          "distinct": true,
          "id": "876f5e0baea7a8a2672ea9ed9bd7ff555d6c5fbb",
          "message": "test(actor-scheduler): fix sharded.rs/host.rs mutation gaps, mealy.rs public-API violations (#969)\n\n## Summary\n\nScheduled test-quality-control pass (continuation of the recurring audit\nseries in `docs/bugs/2026-07-{20,24,26,28}-test-quality-audit*.md`).\nFull writeup: `docs/bugs/2026-07-31-test-quality-audit-followup.md`.\n\n- **`mealy.rs`**: three new `step_os` tests read the private\n`Node.continuation` field directly instead of relying on public return\nvalues (a new STYLE.md \"Test Public API\" violation, caught by a static\naudit of everything changed since the last pass). Rewrote all three to\nprove the same facts through `poll`/`poll_os`'s public `(Step,\nActorStatus)` return values instead.\n- **`sharded.rs`**: fixed 12 of 18 missed `cargo-mutants` mutants in\n`ShardedInbox::drain`/`take_one`'s round-robin arithmetic — a gap first\nflagged 2026-07-20 and never closed in four follow-up passes since.\n`take_one` (reached via the public `Inbox::take` trait method) had\n**zero** test coverage at all before this. The remaining 6 misses were\nhand-verified as genuine equivalent mutants *before* the fix, then\nconfirmed empirically by re-running cargo-mutants after (documented in\nthe audit doc).\n- **`host.rs`**: `GreenSender::send` (the public, documented\nbackoff+wake send path) and its `PortTarget::try_deliver` impl (how a\ngreen-to-green pipeline stage delivers) were never exercised by any\nexisting test — every prior test used the `pub(crate)` `try_send`\ninstead, so a mutant replacing either body with `Ok(())` went\nundetected. Added coverage for both.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `cargo test -p actor-scheduler --lib`: 144/144 passing (was 130\nbefore this pass's 14 new tests)\n- [x] `cargo test -p actor-scheduler` (incl. integration tests and\ndoctests): all passing\n- [x] `cargo check --workspace`: clean\n- [x] `cargo clippy -p actor-scheduler --lib --tests`: clean\n- [x] `cargo mutants` re-run scoped to `sharded.rs`: 18 missed → 6 (all\nconfirmed equivalent)\n- [x] `cargo mutants` re-run scoped to `host.rs`: 2 missed → 0\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_01AvLuW9PtWsaGwossAtqfww)_\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
